<title>USA: Home Bancorp of Elgin to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Home Bancorp of Elgin to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>ELGIN, Ill. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Home Bancorp of Elgin Inc said Tuesday that its board has authorized the repurchase of up to 280,370 shares of common stock, representing about four percent of its approximately 7.0 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The shares will be used to fund awards of restricted stock to certain executives, employees and directors under a recognition and retention plan.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
